{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"女子網球年終賽　安祖莉娃和絲維度蓮娜晉身決賽\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-15-13-59-49FaOO1ltt.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】女子網球年終賽將會由安祖莉娃和絲維度蓮娜爭冠軍。</p><p>湖水綠衫安祖莉娃四強鬥柏高娜，兩盤都是先被破發下贏回對方兩個發球局，贏6比3和6比4，取得決賽資格。對手是2018年冠軍、紅衫的絲維度蓮娜，她在另一場四強以兩盤6比2和6比1，擊敗溫網冠軍露絲高娃，相隔7年再打入決賽。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.358280+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:24.749049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:19.338031+00:00","content_hash":"e08271dc1fe34100e63f05b40753c49625058e748ab3a8f3113a3c98d2519f8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.358280+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}